  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Communication and engagement initiative under the Ukraine Transition Programme - UTP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project contributes to the UTPs strategic objective of strengthening Denmark&#x2019;s partnership with Ukraine by supporting public understanding, engagement and legitimacy around Denmark&#x2019;s long-term civilian engagement. The initiative complements UTP&#x2019;s programmatic interventions by addressing the societal and communicative dimensions of sustained international engagement.</narrative>
  </description>
